From 72955ee7f5de67412f6f52b8a14969a6529bb96a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:30:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/54] hw/display/pvg-linux-pci: display port 0, task address
 spaces, cursor

DefineTask2 task roots and the 1024-entry page table walk; the per-port
shared display state page with a port of the nub state machine (settings,
mode list, generation/ack, event bits + poke interrupt); doorbell cursor
show/position; CursorGlyph read from the kernel task; a QEMU console that
draws the cursor in software. Presented surfaces are traced only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 hw/display/pvg-linux-pci.c | 596 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 hw/display/trace-events    |   7 +
 2 files changed, 601 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

